Subject: [PATCH] btrfs: do not force reloc root creation during
 qgroup_account_snapshot()
References: bsc#1258210
Patch-mainline: 6.18.53
Git-commit: cacf35832292997018837e484283f95a9301ebf5

[ Upstream commit cacf35832292997018837e484283f95a9301ebf5 ]

